{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "morsemate-complete-api-v2",
		"name": "MorseMate API - Complete Collection",
		"description": "Complete API collection for MorseMate application with all 87 endpoints.\n\n**Base URL:** http://localhost:8080\n**API Version:** v1 (for most endpoints)\n\n## Authentication\nMost endpoints require JWT authentication. After login/register, the token is automatically saved.\n\n**How it works:**\n- Register or Login → JWT token auto-saved to `jwt_token` variable\n- Token automatically used in authenticated requests: `Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}`\n\n## Important Notes\n- **Most endpoints** use `/v1` prefix (e.g., `/v1/categories`)\n- **Health & System endpoints** use `/api` prefix (e.g., `/api/health`, `/api/ping`)\n- **Auth endpoints** use no version prefix (e.g., `/auth/login`)\n\n## Collections Overview\n1. **Authentication (4)** - Register, Login, Current User, Health\n2. **Users (14)** - Profile, Statistics, Hearts, Points, Account Management  \n3. **Categories (6)** - Full CRUD with Admin controls\n4. **Lessons (8)** - CRUD, Search, Ordering\n5. **Exercises (8)** - CRUD, Filtering, Random selection\n6. **Achievements (14)** - Management, User tracking, Awards\n7. **Gems (11)** - Balance, Transactions, Admin operations\n8. **PowerUps (11)** - Purchase, Activation, Management\n9. **Leaderboard (10)** - Rankings and user statistics\n10. **Health & System (4)** - API root, Health check, System info, Ping\n\n**Total: 87 Endpoints**",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
		"_exporter_id": "morsemate-2025"
	},
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "1. Authentication",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Register",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
									"    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.environment.set('jwt_token', jsonData.accessToken);",
									"    pm.environment.set('user_id', jsonData.user.id);",
									"    console.log('✅ Registration successful!');",
									"    console.log('Token saved:', jsonData.accessToken.substring(0, 20) + '...');",
									"    console.log('User ID:', jsonData.user.id);",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"testuser\",\n  \"email\": \"test@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Password123\",\n  \"fullName\": \"Test User\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/{{api_version}}/auth/register",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["{{api_version}}", "auth", "register"]
						},
						"description": "Register a new user account.\n\n**Request Body:**\n- `username` (required): 3-50 chars, alphanumeric, underscore, hyphen\n- `email` (required): Valid email format\n- `password` (required): Min 8 chars, must contain uppercase, lowercase, and digit\n- `fullName` (optional): 2-100 chars\n\n**Response:** JWT token + user data"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Login",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
									"    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.environment.set('jwt_token', jsonData.accessToken);",
									"    pm.environment.set('user_id', jsonData.user.id);",
									"    console.log('✅ Login successful!');",
									"    console.log('Token saved:', jsonData.accessToken.substring(0, 20) + '...');",
									"    console.log('User ID:', jsonData.user.id);",
									"    console.log('Role:', jsonData.user.role);",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"identifier\": \"test@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Password123\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/{{api_version}}/auth/login",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["{{api_version}}", "auth", "login"]
						},
						"description": "Authenticate user and get JWT token.\n\n**Request Body:**\n- `identifier` (required): Email OR username\n- `password` (required): User password\n- `rememberMe` (optional): Boolean for extended session\n\n**Response:** JWT token + user data\n\n**Note:** Server automatically detects if identifier is email (contains @) or username"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Get Current User",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Authorization",
								"value": "Bearer {{jwt_token}}",
								"type": "text"
							}
						],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/{{api_version}}/auth/me",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["{{api_version}}", "auth", "me"]
						},
						"description": "Get currently authenticated user's information.\n\n**Requires:** JWT token in Authorization header\n\n**Response:** User profile data"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Auth Health Check",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [],
